flowchart TD
  click[读者点击<br/>收藏 / 已收藏]
  logged_in{已登录?}
  open_login[弹出登录框<br/>LoginDialog]
  kb_guard[键盘翻页守卫<br/>useReaderKeyboardNavigation]
  refetch[重拉详情<br/>refetchAlbumDetail]
  already{服务端已收藏?}
  toast_exist[toast 已在收藏中]
  toggle["切换收藏<br/>useComicFavorite.toggle(isFavorite)"]
  rust[收藏命令<br/>toggle_comic_favorite]
  jm[(JM API<br/>POST /favorite)]
  write_cache[(写回详情缓存<br/>queryKeys.comicDetail)]
  synced[底栏与详情页<br/>显示 已收藏 / 收藏]
  toast_err[toast 收藏操作失败]

  click --> logged_in
  logged_in -->|否| open_login
  open_login -.->|输入时不翻页 / Esc 不退出| kb_guard
  open_login -->|登录成功| refetch
  refetch --> already
  already -->|是| toast_exist
  already -->|否| toggle
  logged_in -->|是| toggle
  toggle -->|invoke| rust
  rust -->|HTTP| jm
  toggle -->|成功| write_cache
  write_cache --> synced
  toggle -->|失败| toast_err
  refetch -->|失败 经 ReaderFavoriteButton| toast_err

